# A diverted batch entry aborts the batch's other staged entries at the
# receiver, as a refused local atomic write aborts its batch.
MODULE: AdmittedNeverDroppedDivertAbortsBatch
TARGET: AdmittedNeverDropped
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a diversion drops the batch's admitted entries
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
                    ELSE /\ st' = [st EXCEPT ![e] = "Diverted"]
--- REPLACE
                    ELSE /\ st' = [x \in Entries |-> IF x = e \/ st[x] = "Staged" THEN "Diverted" ELSE st[x]]
--- END
